From c47e30337a772fa6a5dae483e57127b4132f2f19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zahari Doychev <zdoychev@maxlinear.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Apr 2025 17:20:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] dsa: mxl862xx: Fix compile warning in memset usage

Fix the following compile warnings:

error: passing argument 1 of 'memset' from incompatible scalar storage order
