 .../mxl862xx/host_api/mxl862xx_mdio_relay.c   | 12 +--
 linux/drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c     | 86 +++++++++----------
 3 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 85 deletions(-)

